/Title (When you watch YouTube or Netflix, video data is broken into packets and sent across the Internet. Routers direct those packets through networks until they reach your device. Good bandwidth helps the video play smoothly. Low bandwidth can cause buffering or lower quality.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 766 0 R
/Next 855 0 R
>>
endobj
