/Title (Apps like Zoom, FaceTime, and Google Meet send audio and video as packets in real time. Low latency is important because delays can interrupt conversation. Stable Internet connections improve call quality and make communication clearer.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 766 0 R
/Prev 816 0 R
/Next 856 0 R
>>
endobj
856 0 obj
<<
/Title (Online games constantly send updates between player devices and game servers. This includes movement, actions, scores, and other live information. Low latency matters because even small delays can affect gameplay. Routers and packet switching help keep the game connected.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 766 0 R
/Prev 855 0 R
/Next 817 0 R
>>
endobj
